window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Magic. Romance. Adventure. Twists.</b><br> <br> After an arrow from the god of love twists her fate, Sapphire Hayes’ feelings for the fae prince she once loved—Riven Draevor—have been warped beyond recognition. Every time he touches her, pain rips through her body. Every time he speaks, she wants to strike him down.<br> <br> But she’s trapped. Bound to him by an unbreakable deal and forced into an alliance between the Summer and Winter Courts.<br> <br> As if that isn’t enough, Riven traded his love for Sapphire away in a ruthless fae bargain—turning him into something colder than the ice he wields. Now, he’s nothing but a calculating prince playing a deadly game of politics.<br> <br> And Sapphire? She’s his pawn.<br> <br> But when fate drags Sapphire and Riven into a high-stakes battle against the Night Court, they’ll have to fight side by side—even as their emotions threaten to shatter them both. Because in a world where love and hate are two sides of the same blade, Sapphire must decide whether to fight her fate… or embrace it.<br> <br> Even if it means destroying the man she loved in the process.</p> <p><b>Perfect for fans of slow-burn enemies-to-lovers romance, heart-pounding action, and dark fae fantasy, </b><b><i>Broken Star</i></b><b> by </b><b><i>USA Today</i></b><b> bestselling author Michelle Madow is an unputdownable installment in the </b><b><i>Fae Bound</i></b><b> series that listeners of Rebecca Yarros, Sarah J. Maas, and Cassandra Clare will love!</b></p>"; 
